# Phase 8a (docs/phase8a-brief.md 3.5, 7.4): USB over the unlit face: USB
# first (unlit exit usb), then the USB screen, and the screen after
# disconnect is the one before the face.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p8a-unlit-usb.script
# needs: library
# trace: unlit
# trace: usb
# same: before after_usb
# log: unlit exit usb
# nolog: splash-pass
#
# NOT scriptable in the sim (device-only, listed for P10): the shell's
# sleep path (hold PLAY with the charger in, "unlit skip sleep", U5) lives
# in ui_main.c under `CONFIG_CHARGING && !HAVE_POWEROFF_WHILE_CHARGING`,
# and config.h defines HAVE_POWEROFF_WHILE_CHARGING for every SIMULATOR
# build, where a held PLAY is sys_poweroff() and ends the sim. The skip
# rules are covered by tests/unlit (U2); the 90 s LCD sleep by the device.

wait 4000
sim_clock 10:30
clock_format 24
battery 100
shot before
backlight_expire
wait 3500           # the face is up
usb_connect
wait 1500
shot usb_over_face  # the USB screen (not the face)
usb_disconnect
wait 1500
shot after_usb      # == before
quit
